        <message/>
        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><br /><img style="align: baseline;" title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" />&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">An <span style="color: #e03e2d;"><strong>explosion</strong> </span>has been </span>reported by ${subject_person}<br />on ${opened_at}</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Location of the explosion: ${inc_location}</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Click ${URI_REF} to action this file.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">For any inquires or questions pertaining to this incident, please contact OHS at <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Thank you,</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">OHS Management System</p>
<hr />
<div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong>S'il vous plait ne r&eacute;pondez pas &agrave; ce courriel. Ce syst&egrave;me ne peut pas recevoir de messages. </strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Une <strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;">explosion</span></strong> a &eacute;t&eacute; signal&eacute;e par </span> ${subject_person} le ${opened_at}.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Lieu de l'explosion : </span>${inc_location}</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Cliquez sur ${URI_REF} pour actionner ce dossier.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Pour toute demande ou question relative &agrave; cet incident, veuillez contacter SST &agrave; <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Merci,</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Syst&egrave;me de gestion de la SST</span></p>]]></message_html>
